# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# xcursorgen source for a transparent cursor.
#
# Format: <size> <xhot> <yhot> <filename>
# A fully-transparent PNG makes the cursor invisible.
#
# The image is 24x24 (matching cage's default XCURSOR_SIZE=24) with a valid
# hotspot at (0,0). Provide multiple sizes so wlroots finds a match at any
# requested XCURSOR_SIZE. If the requested size has no matching image,
# wlroots falls back to the built-in visible default cursor.
24 0 0 transparent.png
32 0 0 transparent.png
48 0 0 transparent.png
64 0 0 transparent.png